WEBVTT

00:22.620 --> 00:24.120
Urin!

00:24.330 --> 00:25.670
Urin!

01:01.660 --> 01:02.830
Found her!

01:10.420 --> 01:11.340
Urin.

01:18.010 --> 01:19.470
Onee-chan!

01:19.470 --> 01:20.390
Urin!

01:20.890 --> 01:23.100
I’m so glad...

01:25.100 --> 01:27.230
Onee-chan!

01:27.230 --> 01:29.900
I’m sorry. I left you alone.

01:51.290 --> 01:54.590
So, the day has finally come.

02:12.270 --> 02:14.820
kimi to ireba

02:12.270 --> 02:14.820
If I’m with you -

02:14.820 --> 02:17.650
kimi to itara

02:14.820 --> 02:17.650
because I’m with you -

02:17.650 --> 02:22.280
kokoro ga yasuraku

02:17.650 --> 02:22.280
my heart is at ease.

02:23.240 --> 02:25.830
kimi mo soude

02:23.240 --> 02:25.830
Surely, you’re the same.

02:25.830 --> 02:31.380
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

02:25.830 --> 02:31.380
You’re at ease now, too.

02:32.420 --> 02:39.010
itekuretara ii noni

02:32.420 --> 02:39.010
If you can just admit it,

02:40.760 --> 02:44.350
sono mama

02:40.760 --> 02:44.350
for even time to forget us,

02:45.260 --> 02:58.490
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

02:45.260 --> 02:58.490
it’s only natural, at this rate.

02:59.240 --> 03:09.960
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

02:59.240 --> 03:09.960
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

03:09.960 --> 03:16.840
chiisana yume egaite yukou

03:09.960 --> 03:16.840
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

03:16.840 --> 03:22.760
futaride sasayaka na

03:16.840 --> 03:22.760
And just like that, we are happy

03:24.180 --> 03:28.390
kotoba ga ureshii

03:24.180 --> 03:28.390
over such trifling words

03:28.890 --> 03:33.100
somatteku sora

03:28.890 --> 03:33.100
that paint the sky.

03:50.040 --> 03:53.920
Heart of the Ring, Heart of the Priestess

03:59.670 --> 04:01.840
Thank you for helping me look for my sister.

04:02.380 --> 04:04.180
I love you so much!

04:08.600 --> 04:10.020
I’m Marin.

04:10.020 --> 04:11.060
What’s your name?

04:14.940 --> 04:15.860
Kanon.

04:16.860 --> 04:18.020
Kanon-chan!

04:20.230 --> 04:22.530
I love Kanon-chan so much!

04:22.990 --> 04:26.120
You’re the first friend I’ve made in the Sky!

04:26.820 --> 04:28.080
Sky?

04:29.620 --> 04:31.910
That’s all good, but...

04:31.910 --> 04:34.000
I don’t swing that way...

04:46.720 --> 04:47.640
A turtle?

04:50.510 --> 04:51.430
I-It stood up?!

04:51.770 --> 04:53.600
Is the one over there the priestess?

04:54.190 --> 04:56.020
It talked!

05:06.490 --> 05:07.620
Something’s coming out!

05:07.620 --> 05:10.080
There’s light! It’s flying around!

05:14.750 --> 05:15.620
So beautiful...

05:16.170 --> 05:17.630
I found you,

05:18.420 --> 05:19.880
Priestess of the Sea.

05:20.710 --> 05:22.800
Priestess of the Sea?

05:22.800 --> 05:24.220
Indeed.

05:24.220 --> 05:28.260
You have been chosen to be the Priestess of the Sea, the one who would destroy Sedona.

05:29.600 --> 05:32.890
You guys are just playing around, right?

05:33.850 --> 05:36.690
You think I’d buy this weird stuff?!

05:36.690 --> 05:40.270
Fool! This is the proof of the Priestess of the Sea,

05:40.270 --> 05:41.980
the Bermuda Stone.

05:43.440 --> 05:46.030
All this weird stuff I’m being pulled into...

05:46.030 --> 05:47.990
It’s all because of him.

05:47.990 --> 05:50.990
Him and his ring...

05:57.670 --> 05:59.380
How scary!

05:59.380 --> 06:03.000
The evil aura emitted from this woman...

06:03.000 --> 06:04.710
It’s as if an unworldly being is being summoned!

06:04.710 --> 06:07.550
I’m <i>so</i> sorry for emitting evil auras!

06:07.800 --> 06:11.390
Man, you don’t really have to say it that way, do you?

06:11.390 --> 06:14.560
Jeez, what’s with that shiny thing?

06:14.560 --> 06:16.680
Isn’t that just a little too much?

06:17.020 --> 06:19.810
Back then, when Sedona was being sealed,

06:19.810 --> 06:23.610
the Sky looked just as dark as that aura.

06:23.610 --> 06:24.150
Kanon-chan!

06:24.400 --> 06:25.190
Wait a moment!

06:26.570 --> 06:30.160
As the Priestess of the Sea, you have great responsibilities.

06:30.530 --> 06:32.120
Listen to me.

06:34.160 --> 06:39.000
Um, are you the legendary turtle who went to the Sky and never returned,

06:39.000 --> 06:40.870
the Elder of the Turtles?

06:41.540 --> 06:42.960
Most certainly!

06:44.880 --> 06:47.050
I’m the Elder, Matsumoto.

06:47.050 --> 06:47.970
That’s great!

06:49.170 --> 06:51.550
It’s so great to see you’re doing all right!

06:53.850 --> 06:56.350
What have you been doing up until now?

06:57.430 --> 07:03.690
I put myself into a deep slumber so that I might prepare myself should <i>that</i> moment come -

07:04.360 --> 07:08.690
the moment when Sedona’s seal is released.

07:09.530 --> 07:10.490
Sedona?

07:10.820 --> 07:11.490
Yes.

07:11.490 --> 07:14.620
This is the tomb Sedona was sealed in.

07:15.450 --> 07:19.410
Long ago, Sedona rose up to the Sky from the depths of the Sea.

07:19.410 --> 07:22.630
The hearts of the People of the Sky were tainted,
causing them to succumb to darkness.

07:23.750 --> 07:27.960
Succumbing to darkness...

07:28.260 --> 07:29.010
Yes.

07:29.380 --> 07:33.180
Sedona is a fearful being that taints light with darkness.

07:33.640 --> 07:37.180
If such a being is fully resurrected,

07:37.180 --> 07:41.640
every single trace of light - both in the Sky and the Sea -
will be tainted with darkness.

07:42.270 --> 07:45.150
It taints everything with darkness?

07:45.940 --> 07:50.820
Yes, and for some reason, someone has opened this tomb.

07:50.820 --> 07:53.910
And so, the half that symbolizes the Sky has been released.

07:54.700 --> 07:58.660
Sedona was sealed with its Sky and Sea parts separated.

07:58.660 --> 08:01.580
The released Sky part will mix with the clouds and rain down into the Sea.

08:02.250 --> 08:08.170
I’m afraid that when it happens,
the seal on its Sea half will be broken.

08:10.210 --> 08:15.260
When both parts are combined together,
the power of darkness will finally be completely revived.

08:16.720 --> 08:20.680
Don’t worry. Sedona isn’t much of a threat until then.

08:21.140 --> 08:24.270
Don’t think that we can relax just yet, though,

08:24.270 --> 08:28.610
because Sedona will do anything to revive itself.

08:28.980 --> 08:33.530
You may be the Priestess of the Sea,
but your powers alone won’t be able to reseal Sedona.

08:34.320 --> 08:38.280
Therefore, we need the powers of someone else - the Priestess of the Sky.

08:39.540 --> 08:40.990
Priestess of the Sky?

08:41.790 --> 08:45.750
We need to find her quickly, but...

08:46.380 --> 08:49.960
Just where is she?

08:52.170 --> 08:54.630
Just when I thought she was a nice person...

08:55.090 --> 08:58.100
Evil? What evil?

08:58.350 --> 09:00.010
Oh, that’s good!

09:00.930 --> 09:02.270
Mom?

09:02.270 --> 09:05.810
There’s so much oozing out, and it’s thicker, too!

09:05.810 --> 09:07.270
Your evil aura!

09:07.270 --> 09:08.940
Don’t say evil!

09:09.310 --> 09:10.440
That’s it!

09:10.890 --> 09:12.610
Ah! Take a look at this!

09:14.860 --> 09:16.700
These pebbles are really pretty, aren’t they?

09:16.700 --> 09:17.870
I picked them up at the beach.

09:18.410 --> 09:22.080
I wonder why I feel lucky carrying these around.

09:22.080 --> 09:23.450
Just don’t go selling them, okay?

09:24.200 --> 09:26.750
Oh! Sell them, huh?

09:25.040 --> 09:26.750
Now that's something

09:25.040 --> 09:26.750
I never thought of!

09:26.750 --> 09:29.710
As expected from Kanon! So evil!

09:29.710 --> 09:31.710
I told you I’m not!

09:32.210 --> 09:33.710
It’s okay, don’t you think?

09:33.710 --> 09:36.550
I’m trying to relieve your stress so you can make good predictions,

09:36.970 --> 09:40.220
you super-evil fortuneteller.

09:40.220 --> 09:41.600
You said it again!

09:42.140 --> 09:46.310
Anyway, I said I’m not going to be a fortuneteller.

09:47.020 --> 09:50.980
You know, I come from a family of priests who ward off evil.

09:51.270 --> 09:55.030
But now that we’re being basked in evil,
it seems like that power has weakened.

09:55.030 --> 09:56.200
No one’s gonna believe that.

09:56.490 --> 09:58.610
The same blood is flowing through you!

09:58.610 --> 10:01.580
That’s why you can’t just say you don’t want to.

10:01.580 --> 10:02.700
It doesn’t matter, does it?

10:02.700 --> 10:05.830
Plus, I don’t like it when someone decides how I should live my life.

10:05.830 --> 10:08.870
You will become a fortuneteller...

10:09.250 --> 10:11.710
You must be one...

10:12.540 --> 10:14.170
Don’t come any closer!

10:14.170 --> 10:18.260
Disaster will befall you if you don’t! Weird things will happen!

10:20.590 --> 10:22.510
What weird things?!

10:22.850 --> 10:25.520
I’m not doing any fortunetelling!

10:25.520 --> 10:28.190
And I’ll never be a fortuneteller!

10:30.850 --> 10:34.230
I’ve decided that I’m going to college.

10:34.980 --> 10:38.240
We promised to go to college together.

10:39.070 --> 10:40.160
I want to die...

10:41.200 --> 10:43.870
I don’t want to be alone during my 18th summer.

10:44.740 --> 10:49.540
This is all that guy’s fault!

10:55.250 --> 10:56.960
Huh? I feel it.

10:57.550 --> 10:59.970
An evil heart that’s lost itself.

11:01.180 --> 11:02.970
You should be able to feel it, too.

11:04.140 --> 11:05.930
Really?

11:06.640 --> 11:09.560
So, today is the day.

11:37.920 --> 11:39.590
Another swimsuit girl?

11:39.590 --> 11:41.220
Stop it already.

11:41.220 --> 11:42.550
I’m not gonna buy anything, ’kay?

11:46.560 --> 11:48.930
So, here exists the evil soul?

11:49.560 --> 11:51.390
Evil, again...

12:16.080 --> 12:17.040
This is bad...

12:17.040 --> 12:20.760
What was that? Some pervy woman?

12:48.780 --> 12:51.370
What is this? It stinks!

12:51.370 --> 12:53.000
Kanon-chan!

12:53.910 --> 12:55.620
Is that Sedona?

12:55.620 --> 12:59.920
No, Sedona has not yet been revived.

13:00.460 --> 13:04.340
That is most likely something controlled by it.

13:05.130 --> 13:06.640
The time has come.

13:07.180 --> 13:07.840
Yes!

13:23.990 --> 13:25.030
Fish?

13:31.950 --> 13:32.870
Onee-chan.

13:35.290 --> 13:38.330
Go forth, Priestess of the Sea!

13:45.800 --> 13:46.550
This is...

13:49.720 --> 13:53.930
I’m going to present your evil soul to Master Sedona.

13:54.270 --> 13:56.140
E-Evil?

13:58.350 --> 14:00.560
Urin, please stay here.

14:00.560 --> 14:03.280
Onee-chan, don’t go, please!

14:03.280 --> 14:06.030
It’s all right. You just stay here.

14:06.450 --> 14:07.530
Onee-chan!

14:08.240 --> 14:09.570
Priestess of the Sea!

14:09.570 --> 14:12.330
Just fight the way I told you before!

14:12.580 --> 14:13.290
Get her!

14:13.950 --> 14:15.410
O light of the clear ocean,

14:15.870 --> 14:17.210
do as I command!

14:17.210 --> 14:18.370
Shine over the darkness

14:21.710 --> 14:24.210
and free Kanon-chan!

14:34.470 --> 14:36.220
Kanon-chan, are you all right?

14:36.220 --> 14:37.520
You’re horrible!

14:37.980 --> 14:42.520
You went this far just to make me buy that stone?

14:45.690 --> 14:46.230
Watch out!

14:49.150 --> 14:50.410
Use this opening to run!

14:54.580 --> 14:56.700
What are you saying? It’s all your fault!

14:57.950 --> 14:58.580
Kanon-chan!

15:04.420 --> 15:06.760
What is this? It’s sticky!

15:06.760 --> 15:09.550
I’m gonna suck out that evil soul of yours.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.060
Let go of her!

15:31.780 --> 15:32.990
Onee-chan!

15:32.990 --> 15:34.070
Stop!

15:35.700 --> 15:38.790
Without any power, you’ll just drag her down.

15:47.710 --> 15:52.260
This is obviously fake.

16:04.350 --> 16:05.520
This is...

16:06.570 --> 16:08.940
Kanon-chan! Hurry up and run!

16:18.080 --> 16:19.040
What...

16:20.950 --> 16:22.000
Why...

16:23.540 --> 16:26.590
What is it? That girl...

16:27.790 --> 16:28.630
It can’t be!

16:42.180 --> 16:47.020
No way! This evil girl can’t be the Priestess of the Sky!

16:47.980 --> 16:48.730
Turtle!

16:48.730 --> 16:51.530
Those who deserve to be a priestess should be more pure.

16:50.860 --> 16:52.530
Wh-What the hell?

16:52.860 --> 16:54.280
You think I’ll be tricked again?

16:54.280 --> 16:57.280
I’m not gonna buy this shiny stone!

16:58.330 --> 17:00.160
Kanon-chan is the Priestess of the Sky!

17:00.160 --> 17:02.500
Somehow, I already knew!

17:08.340 --> 17:10.710
Hey! Tell them to stop it already, turtle.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.300
Hey, Sky girl!

17:12.710 --> 17:15.050
If you’re really the Priestess of the Sky,

17:15.050 --> 17:17.340
you’re the one who should fight and stop it!

17:17.340 --> 17:18.010
Huh?

17:18.260 --> 17:21.180
If the Priestess of the Sky and the Priestess of the Sea work together,

17:21.180 --> 17:22.970
the world will never be covered by darkness!

17:23.480 --> 17:25.730
Until the time when Sedona is liberated,

17:25.730 --> 17:27.440
you have no choice but to fight!

17:29.020 --> 17:32.150
Now! Prove to me that you’re really the Priestess of the Sky!

17:32.650 --> 17:35.610
I don’t really understand it, but it’s not my fault!

17:35.820 --> 17:38.620
I hate fighting, and this doesn’t concern me!

17:38.620 --> 17:39.570
It’s all my fault!

17:40.200 --> 17:43.160
It was me. I was the one who opened the lid!

17:45.000 --> 17:47.750
It happened when I was trying to find the ring.

17:48.210 --> 17:49.880
I heard a voice.

17:50.250 --> 17:52.000
It said, "Open the lid."

17:52.630 --> 17:54.550
And then, I...

17:56.420 --> 17:59.390
I was the one who freed Sedona.

18:01.010 --> 18:04.560
I don’t have any power, so I can’t help Onee-chan.

18:04.560 --> 18:06.310
That’s why, if <i>you</i> can...

18:07.140 --> 18:09.190
This was all my fault!

18:10.310 --> 18:14.280
So please, help Onee-chan!

18:15.320 --> 18:17.900
If I hadn’t thrown the ring away...

18:19.740 --> 18:20.820
It <i>was</i> my fault.

18:28.250 --> 18:33.460
I... I... I’ll...

18:37.510 --> 18:38.380
What?!

18:48.060 --> 18:50.310
She’s becoming a Priestess!

18:54.150 --> 18:55.820
No way! What’s with this getup?

18:56.570 --> 18:58.900
Go! Priestesses!

18:58.900 --> 19:00.990
Perform the Dance of Exorcism!

19:00.990 --> 19:03.620
Grand power that protects the ocean,

19:04.870 --> 19:06.790
wipe away this darkness!

19:16.000 --> 19:17.090
Priestess of the Sky!

19:17.090 --> 19:19.880
Chant the spell engraved on that!

19:20.380 --> 19:22.010
O light of the clear sky,

19:22.010 --> 19:23.350
do as I command!

19:25.850 --> 19:28.100
Shine over the darkness!

19:34.900 --> 19:35.980
Good!

19:36.230 --> 19:37.440
No!

19:49.080 --> 19:50.160
What are you doing?!

19:50.960 --> 19:53.080
I think I’ve seen her somewhere before.

19:55.750 --> 19:59.010
Yes, I’ve seen this person.

20:03.300 --> 20:04.720
Don’t! It’s dangerous!

20:35.520 --> 20:38.630
So, instead of defeating Sedona’s warrior,

20:40.140 --> 20:43.220
she purified her.

20:49.100 --> 20:52.180
I’m so glad you’re not badly hurt!

20:59.770 --> 21:06.490
The ones who sealed Sedona were the previous Priestesses.

21:07.450 --> 21:10.330
You girls are really the best pair.

21:10.330 --> 21:14.000
The fated two who will protect the peace.

21:15.370 --> 21:19.000
Hey! Why should I fight in that getup?

21:19.000 --> 21:24.130
And to think that an octopus almost stole my first kiss...

21:28.760 --> 21:29.680
I want to die.

21:37.650 --> 21:38.190
Here.

21:48.790 --> 21:52.040
I don’t think we’re going to meet again, so bye.

21:53.540 --> 21:56.210
Bye, Kanon-chan. See you again!

22:02.550 --> 22:06.550
Like I said, it’s none of my business.

22:26.530 --> 22:31.450
hikari no yurikago

22:26.530 --> 22:31.450
Within a droplet of water,

22:31.870 --> 22:34.990
shizuku no naka ni

22:31.870 --> 22:34.990
a cradle of light

22:35.330 --> 22:38.250
tojikometara

22:35.330 --> 22:38.250
is trapped.

22:38.250 --> 22:43.420
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.250 --> 22:43.420
And so, it colors the water.

22:43.840 --> 22:47.050
mimi wo sumashite

22:43.840 --> 22:47.050
Clear your ears

22:47.050 --> 22:49.720
eien e

22:47.050 --> 22:49.630
to eternity.

22:49.720 --> 22:55.010
hitori de yume no ato

22:49.800 --> 22:55.010
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.010 --> 23:00.350
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.010 --> 23:00.350
if one connects with another,

23:01.060 --> 23:06.940
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.060 --> 23:06.940
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.360 --> 23:11.990
warattemo attete

23:07.360 --> 23:11.990
meets and smiles,

23:11.990 --> 23:19.160
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:11.990 --> 23:19.160
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.160 --> 23:23.880
toumeina inori de

23:19.160 --> 23:23.750
With a transparent prayer,

23:23.880 --> 23:33.220
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:23.880 --> 23:33.220
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:36.260 --> 23:37.100
You know what?

23:37.100 --> 23:39.020
Ponyfish can shine!

23:39.020 --> 23:41.020
Even its dung, too!

23:41.020 --> 23:44.150
Hey, now... Have some shame!

23:44.150 --> 23:45.900
Next time, episode 3:

23:45.020 --> 23:49.940
Approaching Heart

23:47.570 --> 23:49.940
I love everyone!
